# Simulation output: one CSV per run, ~80 MB each, and fully regenerated by re-running a world.
controllers/*/logs/

# The uncompressed capture Webots writes during a run; the delivered files are re-encoded from it.
media/postopt_raw.mp4

# Python and Julia scratch
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
notebook_cell.jl

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp

# Note: analysis/results/ is deliberately NOT ignored, unlike a typical analysis repository. The fitted
# payload is a deliverable here — the parity fixtures and the shipped parameter file are generated from
# it — so a clone can re-export and re-check the model without fitting anything.
